category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libGL-devel libGLU-devel libglut-devel libgtest-devel python3-devel swig zlib-devel
sdesc: "Library for particle IO and manipulation (utilities)"
ldesc: "This is the initial source code release of partio a tool we used for particle
reading/writing. It started out as an abstraction for the commonalities in
particle models (i.e. accessing many attributes associated with an index or
entity)."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/wdas/partio
